ciency.", "observed_result": "Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.", "observed_sample_and_power": "SE per cell reported", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "inconclusive", "observed_failure_type": "E_unclear", "observed_notes": "NOT_RECORDED", "auto_confidence": "medium (0.65)"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-050"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-067", "label": "Study family SF-APPS-067: Opponent action T -> your offense T+1 (def-matched 8x8)", "score": 0.315, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-APPS-067 (0.23)", "request matches VAR:PPP_points_per_possession (0.34); FAM:SF-APPS-067 auto_measures VAR:PPP_points_per_possession"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Opponent action T -> your offense T+1 (def-matched 8x8)", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "The opponent's previous play type changes your next-possession PPP after matching on defensive team.", "observed_result": "3/64 FINDING cells survive both matchings: SPOT_UP->TRANSITION ATT=-0.085; POST_UP->TRANSITION -0.083; PNR->DRIVE -0.058 (all also survive +prev_made). PULL_UP->DRIVE dropped as defense-quality confound.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Three cells replicate under def-match, off-match, and prev_made control. Most of 64 are null.", "observed_sample_and_power": "64 cells tested; 3 FINDING", "auto_validation_status": "same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPS-067: 'matching primary; sensitivity match on own offense. bh-fdr+placebo+ft-clean